OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet start, with this band of
OL,6,Frain, sometimes heavy, quickly
OL,7,Fclearing, allowing for sunny spells.
OL,8,
OL,9,CTonight:FShowers easing into the
OL,10,Fevening, with clear spells around.
OL,11,FFeeling mild with winds easing to
OL,12,Fstart, before strengthening again from
OL,13,Fthe west into Wednesday morning.
OL,14,
OL,15,CWednesday:FPlenty of sunshine around
OL,16,Fto start on Wednesday. Still feeling
OL,17,Fmild, with cloud building through the
OL,18,Fmorning. Very windy with gales along
OL,19,Fexposed coasts and on hills.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
