OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FRain
OL,6,Fpushes southeastwards Thursday into
OL,7,FFriday. Winds ease dramatically
OL,8,Fbehind, with temperatures returning
OL,9,Fcloser to average. Cooler with showers
OL,10,Fon Friday. Turning sunnier, and more
OL,11,Fsettled into the weekend.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
